== bad json: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: bad json: unexpected EOF
== no agent: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: agent is required
== no input: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: no input: provide "segments" (or a top-level "prompt" string)
== bad block type: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: segments[0].content[0]: unknown type "trusted-txt" (allowed: trusted-text, untrusted-block, image)
== bad user_id: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: user_id must be 1-320 characters: letters, digits and _ - : . @ |
== bad agent_id: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: agent_id must match [A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,128}
== unknown agent: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: unknown agent "nope"
== bad admission: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: admission must be "wait" or "reject"
== bad retention: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: retention must be "none" or "default", not "forever"
== bad max_wall_seconds: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: max_wall_seconds must be between 0 and 2592000
== bad user_bearer: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: user_bearer must match [A-Za-z0-9._\-+/=]{16,512}
== bad user_credentials: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: user_credentials: key "bad key!" must match [a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,64}
== bad idempotency_key: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: idempotency_key must match [A-Za-z0-9:._-]{1,200}
== idempotency_key with session: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: idempotency_key applies to a fresh run that starts at once, on a runtime with a store
== unknown session: POST /v1/runs
status: 404
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: session not found: <id:1>
== bad tool_choice: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: tool_choice.mode "sometimes" is not one of auto, none, required, tool
== unknown user_tier: POST /v1/runs
status: 400
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body: unknown user_tier "gold"
